  "description": "*“When the fog thickens, they’ll come, with faces that are exactly the same as before.”* \n\nSeo-Uri, who has lived her entire life as the daughter of a murderer, heads to her maternal grandmother’s rural village after hearing news of her grandmother’s death. There, she encounters a ghost incident that is exactly the same as the one her mother experienced 18 years ago.\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
